flowchart TD
    S["Require nonempty collection allowlist before capture"]:::service --> A
    A["C0: retain source and workspace capture"]:::job --> B["Full policy and canonical descriptor join"]:::service
    B --> C["Require absent namespace and clear negative guards"]:::db
    C --> D["Publish no-replace seal through C0; sync and retain created File"]:::storage
    D --> E["Close C0 directories; C1 captures same source and seal"]:::job
    E --> F["Recheck policy; prepare C1 historical cutoff"]:::service
    F --> G["Stage four rows; bounded exact readback"]:::db
    G --> H["Reverify native hashes and saved scope"]:::job
    H --> I["Final retained metadata, edge and seal check"]:::storage
    I --> J["Sole SQL commit"]:::db
    J --> K["Installed receipt and sampled checkout relation"]:::service
    G -. "Failure before commit" .-> L["Roll back SQL; retain published seal; unavailable"]:::external
    I -. "Failure" .-> L
